<h1>Reset your password</h1>
<p>
  Someone asked to reset the password for <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong> on <%= site_name %>.
  If that was you, choose a new one.
</p>
<p><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token), class: "button" %></p>
<p class="note">
  The link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
  If you didn't ask for this, ignore this email and your password stays as it is.
</p>
